      "locator": "Page: 1, Section: part_i",
      "exact_span": "Total Copper             N/A               N/A               0.011             0.011              1/Week               Grab",
      "affected_purpose": "A,B",
      "computation_change_reason": "N/A in lb/day columns versus numeric mg/l limits affects which unit and limit type applies to reported copper measurements (A) and whether weekly grab monitoring is in scope (B)."
    },
    {
      "source": "gcc/minor_modification.pdf",
      "locator": "Page: 1, Section: part_i",
      "exact_span": "Dissolved Copper         N/A               N/A               Report            Report             1/Week               Grab",
      "affected_purpose": "A,B,C",
      "computation_change_reason": "'Report' in both mg/l columns signals no numeric compliance comparison, but weekly grab monitoring may still apply; treating Report as a limit or as monitoring-only changes exceedance evaluation (A), obligation scope (B), and missing-data classification (C)."
    },
    {
      "source": "gcc/minor_modification.pdf",
      "locator": "Page: 1, Section: part_i",
      "exact_span": "Dissolved Cadmium        N/A               N/A               Report            Report             1/Week               Grab",
