      "computation_change_reason": "Same Report-vs-enforceable-limit ambiguity as dissolved copper: interpretation changes whether cadmium results are compared to limits (A), whether weekly monitoring was required (B), and how absent results are semantically categorized (C)."
    },
    {
      "source": "gcc/minor_modification.pdf",
      "locator": "Page: 1, Section: part_i",
      "exact_span": "Total Hardness           N/A               N/A               N/A               Report             1/Week               Grab",
      "affected_purpose": "A,B,C",
      "computation_change_reason": "Only the Daily Max mg/l column is 'Report' while others are N/A; whether hardness is report-only with required monitoring or entirely non-operative affects limit applicability (A), monitoring obligations (B), and missing-evidence handling (C)."
    }
  ]
}
